        "message": "={{ `Hello ${$json.client_name},\\n\\nYour project workspace for ${$json.project_name} is ready. You can use this folder to coordinate briefs, reference assets, concepts, final creatives and reports:\\n\\n${$json.root_folder_url}\\n\\nPlease share assets only through the agreed project process.\\n\\nBest regards` }}",
